# Wordle Duel Environment Variables

# ── LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Not needed for local dev — Vite proxies socket.io to localhost:3001 automatically.

# ── GITHUB PAGES DEPLOYMENT ───────────────────────────────────
# Set this as a GitHub Actions Secret (repo → Settings → Secrets → Actions):
#
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://your-app-name.onrender.com
#
# This tells the GitHub Pages frontend where the backend lives.

# ── RENDER DEPLOYMENT ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Set this environment variable in your Render service:
#
# NODE_ENV=production
